TI  - Artificial intelligence meets genomic selection: comparing deep learning and GBLUP across diverse plant datasets
AU  - Montesinos-López, Abelardo
AU  - Montesinos-López, Osval A.
AU  - Ramos-Pulido, Sofia
AU  - Mosqueda-González, Brandon Alejandro
